    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="264dff67-d192-5c8f-947c-e117885e43a0" activityNameId="d81ec5a8-82bc-50c8-8ebf-aca51f31dfd9" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Electricity, biogas, allocation exergy, at SOFC fuel cell 125kWe, future</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Electricity, biogas, allocation exergy, at SOFC fuel cell 125kWe, future
The multioutput-process 'biogas, burned in SOFC fuel cell 125kWe delivers the coproducts 'heat, biogas, allocation exergy, at SOFC fuel cell 125kWe' and 'electricity, biogas, allocation exergy, at SOFC fuel cell 125kWe' . The exergy allocation is the allocation scheme suggested to be used within the ecoinvent database (e.g. in electricity mixes).;
UUID: cd71d240-159e-34a6-8ee6-940eaff91a79
The module includes fuel input, infrastructure, emissions to air, and working materials for operation.
Location: Biogas input modelled for conditions in Switzerland. Process applicable in central European conditions.
Technology: Solid oxide fuel cell (SOFC) with unpressurised tubular stack design for central cogeneration use. Performance, stack lifetime and catalyst use according to expected future values for a serial product. Operation with refined biogas from low pressure gas network. Electrical efficiency 47%, total efficiency 80%. Operation as base load engine with low partial load hours. 
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature data and manufacturer information 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_cd71d240-159e-34a6-8ee6-940eaff91a79.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="fdab769f-4bdb-5024-8349-c1745bbb2597" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
